{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"6bef674f-1c82-504b-9961-6c545f84b2b9","excerpt":"이전 기록에서 Spring Boot Application을 Dockerfile을 활용해 docker iamge로 빌드했다. 이제 소스 코드가 push되면 해당 소스 코드를 image로 빌드하고, ECR에 push하는 과정을 github Actions 스크립트를 통해 자동화해보자. image build & ECR push 자동화 ECR repository …","html":"<p>이전 기록에서 Spring Boot Application을 Dockerfile을 활용해 docker iamge로 빌드했다.</p>\n<p>이제 <strong>소스 코드가 push되면 해당 소스 코드를 image로 빌드하고, ECR에 push하는 과정을 github Actions 스크립트를 통해 자동화</strong>해보자.</p>\n<h2 id=\"image-build--ECR-push-자동화\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#image-build--ECR-push-%EC%9E%90%EB%8F%99%ED%99%94\" aria-label=\"image build  ECR push 자동화 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>image build &#x26; ECR push 자동화</h2>\n<h3 id=\"ECR-repository-생성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#ECR-repository-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"ECR repository 생성 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>ECR repository 생성</h3>\n<p>먼저 AWS 콘솔에 들어가 ECR Repository를 생성한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"생성한-repository-정보-github-secret에-등록\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%ED%95%9C-repository-%EC%A0%95%EB%B3%B4-github-secret%EC%97%90-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D\" aria-label=\"생성한 repository 정보 github secret에 등록 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>생성한 repository 정보 github secret에 등록</h3>\n<p>생성한 Repository에 Github Actions가 image를 push하기 위해선 해당 Repository의 정보를 알고 있어야 한다. 하지만 외부에 repository에 대한 정보가 공개되면 안되기 때문에 github secrets에 등록해보자.</p>\n<p>Github Repository의 \"Settings\">\"Secrets and variables\">\"Actions\"에서 repository secrets를 등록해주면, <strong>외부에 ECR repository 정보를 공개하지 않으면서 Github Actions가 그 값들을 사용할 수 있다.</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"ECR-push-권한-부여\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#ECR-push-%EA%B6%8C%ED%95%9C-%EB%B6%80%EC%97%AC\" aria-label=\"ECR push 권한 부여 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>ECR push 권한 부여</h3>\n<p><strong>ECR에 image를 push하기 위해선 Github Actions에게 그에 대한 권한을 부여</strong>해야 한다.\n따라서 AWS 콘솔에서 IAM에 들어가 사용자를 생성하고, 해당 사용자의 ACCESS<em>ID와 ACCESS</em>KEY도 github repository secrets에 등록해주자.</p>\n<h3 id=\"Github-Actions-스크립트-생성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Github-Actions-%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%BD%ED%8A%B8-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"Github Actions 스크립트 생성 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>Github Actions 스크립트 생성</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"workflow\"><pre class=\"language-workflow\"><code class=\"language-workflow\">name: CI/CD  \n  \non:  \n  push:  \n    branches:  \n      - master  \n  \nenv:  \n  ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ secrets.AWS_ECR_REGISTRY }}  \n  ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.AWS_PROD_ECR_REPOSITORY }}  \njobs:  \n  build-and-push:  \n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest  \n  \n    steps:  \n      - name: Checkout repository  \n        uses: actions/checkout@v3  \n  \n      - name: Configure AWS CLI  \n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v2  \n        with:  \n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}  \n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}  \n          aws-region: ap-northeast-2  \n  \n      - name: Log in to Amazon ECR  \n        id: login-ecr  \n        uses: aws-actions/amazon-ecr-login@v1  \n  \n      - name: Build and Push Docker Image  \n        env:  \n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ github.sha }}-${{ github.run_number }}  \n        run: |  \n          docker build -t $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG .  \n          docker push $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG</code></pre></div>\n<p>위 스크립트는 등록된 repository secrets를 이용해 image를 ECRd에 push하는 스크립트다.\n위 과정을 도식화하면, 다음과 같다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/600f6/ecr-architecture.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 22.352941176470587%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='ecr architecture' title='' src='/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/ca1dc/ecr-architecture.png' srcset='/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/e7570/ecr-architecture.png 170w,\n/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/f46e7/ecr-architecture.png 340w,\n/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/ca1dc/ecr-architecture.png 680w,\n/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/02d09/ecr-architecture.png 1020w,\n/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/9d567/ecr-architecture.png 1360w,\n/static/526a6b187b7f6fe83169a82d4916b602/600f6/ecr-architecture.png 1548w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n이제 소스코드를 master branch에 push하면, 생성된 ECR repository에 이미지가 정상적으로 push 되는 것을 확인할 수 있다.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)","date":"December 07, 2024","update":"December 18, 2024","tags":["aws"],"series":"Elastic Beanstalk로 Spring Boot Application CI/CD 구축"},"fields":{"slug":"/Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)/","readingTime":{"minutes":2.285}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"94c8da75-e3eb-5090-891a-c89f4f14b247","fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk이란 무엇일까/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk이란 무엇일까"}}},{"node":{"id":"c6ece453-4a6b-5c41-800d-aa6e88b6490f","fields":{"slug":"/인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드"}}},{"node":{"id":"6bef674f-1c82-504b-9961-6c545f84b2b9","fields":{"slug":"/Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring Boot Application Image ECR에 push(CI)"}}},{"node":{"id":"3aa5f43b-2e5f-5042-a259-dbac2763aea9","fields":{"slug":"/Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Elastic Beanstalk에 애플리케이션 배포, 자동화(CD)"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"인프라 구조 설계, 간단한 API 서버 이미지 빌드"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/소프트웨어마에스트로(SWM) 회고/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"소프트웨어마에스트로(SWM) 회고"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"6bef674f-1c82-504b-9961-6c545f84b2b9","series":"Elastic Beanstalk로 Spring Boot Application CI/CD 구축","previousPostId":"c6ece453-4a6b-5c41-800d-aa6e88b6490f","nextPostId":"f37b3ff7-e3b1-53a1-9cb3-b0bc0799b825"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}